    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 31,
      "end": 36,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "คนอย่างฉันนั้นมีสักเท่าไรที่เธอนั้นจะสน",
      "pronunciation_kana": "khon-yang-chan-nan-mi-sak-thao-rai-thi-thoe-nan-cha-son",
      "pronunciation_roman": "khon yang channan mi sak thaorai thi thoe nan cha son",
      "translation": "僕みたいな人なんて、君はどれくらい気にしてくれるんだろう"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 36,
      "end": 43,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "ใจได้แต่งงานเงยมองขึ้นไปสูงเกินจะใส่",
      "pronunciation_kana": "chai-dai-thaeng-ngan-nge-mong-khuen-pai-sung-koen-cha-sai",
      "pronunciation_roman": "chai dai taengngan ngoei mong khuenpai sung koen cha sai",
      "translation": "結婚なんて、顔を上げて見上げるほど高すぎて届かない"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 43,
      "end": 54,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "เธอจะเห็นใครยืนอยู่",
      "pronunciation_kana": "thoe-cha-hen-khrai-yuen-yu",
      "pronunciation_roman": "thoe cha en khain yuen yu",
      "translation": "君には誰が立っているのが見えるかな"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 54,
      "end": 61,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[เพลง]",
      "pronunciation_kana": "pleng",
      "pronunciation_roman": "[ phenng ]",
      "translation": "（音楽）"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 61,
      "end": 74,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "แต่ยิ่งขึ้นไปก็ยังคงไกลอยากให้เธอเป็นมา ได้ไหมดูยังไง",
      "pronunciation_kana": "tae-ying-khuen-pai-ko-yang-khong-klai-yak-ให้-thoe-pen-ma-dai-mai-du-yang-ngai",
      "pronunciation_roman": "tae yingkhuenpai k yangkng klai yak hai thoe penma dai mai du yangngai",
      "translation": "でも登れば登るほど遠くて、君にそばに来てほしいんだ、どう見えるかな"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 74,
      "end": 82,
