      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[เพลง]",
      "pronunciation_kana": "pleng",
      "pronunciation_roman": "[ phenng ]",
      "translation": "（音楽）"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 123,
      "end": 135,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[เพลง]",
      "pronunciation_kana": "pleng",
      "pronunciation_roman": "[ phenng ]",
      "translation": "（音楽）"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 135,
      "end": 140,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "อยากให้เธอรู้ว่าไม่มีสักวันที่ฉันจะไม่",
      "pronunciation_kana": "yak-ให้-thoe-ru-wa-mai-mi-sak-wan-thi-chan-cha-mai",
      "pronunciation_roman": "yak hai thoe ru wa mai mi sak wanthi chan cha mai",
      "translation": "君に知ってほしい、僕が君を探さない日なんて一日もないってこと"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 140,
      "end": 148,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "มองหาเธอให้เธอลงมาอยากให้เธอมองตาฉันจะ",
      "pronunciation_kana": "mong-หา-thoe-ให้-thoe-long-ma-yak-ให้-thoe-mong-ta-chan-cha",
      "pronunciation_roman": "mongha thoe hai thoe langama yak hai thoe mong ta chan cha",
      "translation": "君に降りてきてほしい、僕の目を見つめてほしい、そうすれば"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 148,
      "end": 163,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "เห็นเพียงแสงดาวที่ฉันเฝ้ามองทุกครั้ง",
      "pronunciation_kana": "hen-phiang-saeng-dao-thi-chan-fao-mong-thuk-krang",
      "pronunciation_roman": "en phiang saeng dao thi chan faomong thukkrang",
      "translation": "僕がいつも見つめている星の光だけが見えるはずだから"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 163,
      "end": 172,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "อยากให้เธอเป็นลงมาได้ไหมเธออยู่",
      "pronunciation_kana": "yak-ให้-thoe-pen-long-ma-dai-mai-thoe-yu",
      "pronunciation_roman": "yak hai thoe pen langama dai mai thoe yu",
      "translation": "降りてきてくれないかな、君はそこにいるの"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 172,
      "end": 177,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[เพลง]",
      "pronunciation_kana": "pleng",
      "pronunciation_roman": "[ phenng ]",
      "translation": "（音楽）"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 177,
      "end": 183,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "ด้วยกันอยู่ด้วยกัน",
      "pronunciation_kana": "duy-kan-yu-duy-kan",
      "pronunciation_roman": "duaikan yu duaikan",
      "translation": "一緒に、一緒にいよう"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 183,
      "end": 197,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[เพลง]",
      "pronunciation_kana": "pleng",
