      "translation": "（拍手）"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 205,
      "end": 212,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "รู้ไหมว่าเธอเป็นเหมือนเดิม",
      "pronunciation_kana": "ru-mai-wa-thoe-pen-muean-doem",
      "pronunciation_roman": "ru mai wa thoe pen emuendoem",
      "translation": "君がいつものままだって知っているかい"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 212,
      "end": 227,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "แต่ยิ่งขึ้นไปก็ยังคงไกลอยากให้เธอเป็นลง มาได้ไหมดู",
      "pronunciation_kana": "tae-ying-khuen-pai-ko-yang-khong-klai-yak-ให้-thoe-pen-long-ma-dai-mai-du",
      "pronunciation_roman": "tae yingkhuenpai k yangkng klai yak hai thoe pen long ma dai mai du",
      "translation": "でも登れば登るほど遠くて、下に降りてきてくれないかな、どう"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 227,
      "end": 230,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[เพลง]",
      "pronunciation_kana": "pleng",
      "pronunciation_roman": "[ phenng ]",
      "translation": "（音楽）"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 230,
      "end": 239,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "ไหมว่าเธอส่งเสียงเพราะฉันนั้น",
      "pronunciation_kana": "mai-wa-thoe-song-siang-phro-chan-nan",
      "pronunciation_roman": "mai wa thoe sangasiang phera channan",
      "translation": "君の声が響くのが分かるかい、だって僕は"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 239,
      "end": 251,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "คงไกลอยากให้เธอบินลงมาได้ไหมได้ไหม",
      "pronunciation_kana": "khong-klai-yak-ให้-thoe-bin-long-ma-dai-mai-dai-mai",
      "pronunciation_roman": "khong klai yak hai thoe bin langama dai mai dai mai",
      "translation": "まだまだ遠くて、飛んで降りてきてほしいんだ、いいだろう"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 251,
      "end": 252,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[เพลง]",
      "pronunciation_kana": "pleng",
      "pronunciation_roman": "[ phenng ]",
      "translation": "（音楽）"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 252,
      "end": 256,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "อยากให้เธอลงมาอยู่ด้วยกันอยู่",
      "pronunciation_kana": "yak-ให้-thoe-long-ma-yu-duy-kan-yu",
      "pronunciation_roman": "yak hai thoe langama yu duaikan yu",
      "translation": "下に降りてきて一緒にいてほしいんだ"
